  _subtitle: The Good Witch of the South
  _description: The most powerful of the witches. She rules the Quadlings from [[0185e89b-fbd0-40a6-a066-8b886f3534be|Glinda's
    Palace]] and tells [[74be2f99-978f-4a21-9eca-fc675e81362d|Dorothy Gale]] the
    secret of the [[3cbd0685-ef92-4b23-a0b9-dac72c467ecb|Silver Shoes]].
